libemf2svg
------------------------------------------
MS EMF (Enhanced Metafile) to SVG conversion library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libargp-20250917-2
  libemf2svg1-1.8.2-1bl1
  libfontconfig1-2.18.3-1
  libfreetype6-2.13.3-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libpng16-1.6.59-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libuemf0-0.2.8-1bl2

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libargp-devel-20250917-2
  libfontconfig-devel-2.18.3-1
  libfreetype-devel-2.13.3-1
  libiconv-devel-1.19-2
  libpng-devel-1.6.59-1
  libuemf-devel-0.2.8-1bl2
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/claricle/libemf2svg

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/claricle/libemf2svg/archive/refs/tags/v1.8.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libemf2svg-1.8.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libemf2svg-1.8.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libemf2svg-1.8.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libemf2svg-1.8.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libemf2svg1-1.8.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libemf2svg-devel-1.8.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libemf2svg)
  /usr/bin/emf2svg-conv.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libemf2svg.README
  /usr/share/doc/libemf2svg/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libemf2svg/README.md

(libemf2svg1)
  /usr/bin/cygemf2svg-1.dll

(libemf2svg-devel)
  /usr/include/emf2svg.h
  /usr/lib/libemf2svg.dll.a

